statement.paragraph:
Let $S$ be the parallelogram determined by the vectors $\textbf{b}_{1} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
      {- 2} \\
      3
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$ and $\textbf{b}_{2} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
